{
  "//": "Ignores only. The file set is chosen at each call site, never here: lint-staged passes the staged paths (gate 2, per-file), and the gate-5 sweep passes **/*.md itself (gate-5-push.md). A globs entry here is combined with the path arguments lint-staged passes, widening its per-file scope to the whole tree — the defect the scope split closed (docs/specs/2026-08-01-markdown-gate-scope-design.md).",
  "ignores": ["node_modules/**", "coverage/**", ".logs/**"],
}
